{"title":"Deerhide Feet","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Leatherworking Lv 1) · Monster drop: Hill Giant Adolescent</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-req\"><b>Requires</b> Lvl 5 · DEX 20 <span class=\"muted\">to equip</span></p>\n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Leatherworking at level 1 <span class=\"muted\">(150 XP)</span> from 1× <a href=\"#/item/deer-hide\">Deer Hide</a>, 1× <a href=\"#/item/wool\">Wool</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"hill-giant-adolescent\" title=\"Hill Giant Adolescent - Normal, 1.7% of recorded drops (1 / 60 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/9beef5a6d257406a5827.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Hill Giant Adolescent</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1.7%</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Share of logged loot events from this monster, not a per-kill chance.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"deerhide-feet\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/leatherworking\">Leatherworking</a></p>\n      <h2>Quality</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Quality\"><a class=\"q-chip q-all\" href=\"#/item/deerhide-feet\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip q-inferior\" href=\"#/item/deerhide-feet?q=inferior\">Inferior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-crude\" href=\"#/item/deerhide-feet?q=crude\">Crude</a><a class=\"q-chip q-shoddy\" href=\"#/item/deerhide-feet?q=shoddy\">Shoddy</a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/deerhide-feet?q=ordinary\">Ordinary <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on q-good\" href=\"#/item/deerhide-feet?q=good\">Good</a><a class=\"q-chip q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/deerhide-feet?q=excellent